{"seq":3,"slug":"recording-rules-alerting-incident","title":"Recording/Alerting Rules 工程化与线上故障排查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/grafana-mimir-victoriametrics-metrics-tsdb/operations-query-promql/recording-rules-alerting-incident","wordCount":2292,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"recording-alerting-rules-工程化与线上故障排查\">Recording/Alerting Rules 工程化与线上故障排查</h1><p>Mimir 的 ruler 把「每分钟执行一次 PromQL」变成一条独立生产链路：自带 querier 读对象存储、结果经 distributor 写回 ingester、firing 告警推给 Alertmanager。任一环落后于 <code>evaluation_interval</code>，症状都不是 ruler 报错，而是<strong>记录规则出现空洞</strong>——面板上一段时间序列无故断裂，而 <code>up</code> 指标一切正常。本文按「求值时序 → 规则设计 → 告警状态机 → 多租户容量 → 故障排查」拆解这条链路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-interval-offset-delay-三者互不替代\">核心概念：interval、offset、delay 三者互不替代</h2><p>三个参数经常混为一谈，但它们在时间轴上作用的位置完全不同。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>evaluation_interval</code>（Mimir <code>-ruler.evaluation-interval</code>，默认 <strong>1m</strong>；Prometheus <code>global.evaluation_interval</code> 同样默认 <strong>1m</strong>）决定 ruler <strong>多久看一次表</strong>。</li>\n<li><code>query_offset</code> / <code>rule_query_offset</code>（Prometheus <code>global.rule_query_offset</code> 默认 <strong>0s</strong>，规则组可覆盖）决定每次看表时<strong>把求值时刻往回推多久</strong>，用于绕开远端写入的到达延迟。</li>\n<li><code>ruler_evaluation_delay_duration</code>（Mimir <code>-ruler.evaluation-delay-duration</code>，默认 <strong>1m</strong>）是 Mimir 特有的<strong>全局延迟</strong>，官方注释写明其用途是延迟求值以确保底层指标已被推送（<a href=\"https://grafana.com/docs/mimir/latest/references/configuration-parameters/\">Mimir 配置参数</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>设求值触发时刻为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>、写入延迟上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，则记录规则实际读取的样本必须满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>sample</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>offset</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{sample}} \\le t - \\Delta_{\\text{offset}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9221em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sample</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">offset</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>offset</mtext></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{\\text{offset}} &lt; L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">offset</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，就会读到「数据还没到」的空窗口，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">rate()</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 返回空向量，该分钟的记录点被静默跳过。这正是 Mimir 文档承认的失败模式：ruler 的 internal 模式不使用查询加速，高基数表达式可能超出求值区间，「may lead to missing data points in the evaluated recording rules」（<a href=\"https://grafana.com/docs/mimir/latest/references/architecture/components/ruler/\">Mimir ruler</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[scrape 时刻 t] --&gt; B[远端写入到达&lt;br/&gt;延迟 L]&#10;    B --&gt; C[ruler 触发求值&lt;br/&gt;每 evaluation_interval]&#10;    C --&gt; D[减去 query_offset]&#10;    D --&gt; E{样本已到达?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[求值成功&lt;br/&gt;写回 distributor]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[空向量&lt;br/&gt;记录点静默丢失]&#10;    F --&gt; H[经 distributor&lt;br/&gt;进入 ingester]&#10;    G --&gt; I[面板出现空洞]\">graph TD\n    A[scrape 时刻 t] --&gt; B[远端写入到达&lt;br/&gt;延迟 L]\n    B --&gt; C[ruler 触发求值&lt;br/&gt;每 evaluation_interval]\n    C --&gt; D[减去 query_offset]\n    D --&gt; E{样本已到达?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[求值成功&lt;br/&gt;写回 distributor]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[空向量&lt;br/&gt;记录点静默丢失]\n    F --&gt; H[经 distributor&lt;br/&gt;进入 ingester]\n    G --&gt; I[面板出现空洞]</pre><p>因此定位记录规则断点的第一步不是看 ruler 日志，而是比对<strong>写入延迟分布</strong>与 <strong>offset 配置</strong>。VictoriaMetrics 的 vmalert 用等价但命名不同的机制：<code>eval_delay</code> 默认取 <code>-rule.evalDelay</code>（<strong>30s</strong>），<code>eval_alignment</code> 自 v1.95 起默认 <code>true</code>，把求值时间戳对齐到组区间而非真实墙钟时间，使结果与 vmui/Grafana 图线对齐（<a href=\"https://docs.victoriametrics.com/victoriametrics/vmalert/\">vmalert</a>）。</p>\n<p>另一个坑是<strong>规则链</strong>：规则 A 的输出要被 B 读取，就必须等 A 写完。Prometheus 规则组内是顺序执行（<a href=\"https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration/recording_rules/\">recording rules</a>），但 Mimir/vmalert 的结果写入是异步的，vmalert 文档明确警告不要把记录规则串成链而不计刷新延迟——安全距离是让下游规则的 <code>query_offset</code> 至少覆盖上游一个求值周期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规则命名与聚合层级-level-metric-operations\">规则命名与聚合层级：level:metric:operations</h2><p>Prometheus 官方最佳实践规定记录规则名用 <code>level:metric:operations</code> 三段式，冒号是硬性信号——<strong>带冒号的指标只可能来自记录规则，不会被 exporter 生产</strong>（<a href=\"https://prometheus.io/docs/practices/rules/\">Recording rules best practices</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>level</code></td>\n<td>输出携带的聚合层级与标签</td>\n<td><code>job</code>、<code>path</code>、<code>instance_path</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>metric</code></td>\n<td>指标名，用 <code>rate()</code>/<code>irate()</code> 时剥掉 <code>_total</code></td>\n<td><code>requests</code>、<code>request_failures</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>operations</code></td>\n<td>施加的运算，<strong>最新操作在前</strong></td>\n<td><code>rate5m</code>、<code>sum_rate5m</code>、<code>ratio_rate5m</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三条硬规则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><code>_sum</code> 可省略</strong>——只要还有别的操作，<code>sum()</code> 就不写进名字；结合律操作可合并（<code>min_min</code> 等价于 <code>min</code>）。</li>\n<li><strong>比率用 <code>_per_</code> 连接两个指标，操作名固定为 <code>ratio</code></strong>，且聚合比率时必须<strong>分子分母分别累加后再相除</strong>，绝不能对已有比率再取平均。</li>\n<li><strong>跨层级聚合必须显式写 <code>without</code> 子句</strong>列出要消去的标签（如 <code>sum without (instance)</code>），以保留 <code>job</code> 等其余标签、避免后续 join 冲突。若 <code>without</code> 里的标签恰好等于 <code>level</code> 段列出的标签，层级推断正确；不等就是规则写错了。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Summary 类型求平均观测值是个特例：保持原指标名、把操作里的 <code>rate</code> 换成 <code>mean</code>，而非拆 <code>_count</code>/<code>_sum</code> 相除。</p>\n<p>命名之外的容量陷阱是<strong>基数的静默乘积</strong>：一条 <code>sum without (instance)</code> 的输出基数等于除 <code>instance</code> 外所有剩余标签的组合数，源指标若带 <code>pod</code>、<code>container</code>、<code>replica</code> 这类高动态标签，记录结果会比原始指标更早触顶。这正是 Mimir <code>-ruler.max-rules-per-rule-group</code>（默认 <strong>20</strong>）与 <code>-ruler.max-rule-groups-per-tenant</code>（默认 <strong>70</strong>）的用意——限额不是目的，逼作者写规则时就想基数才是。这类治理与 <a href=\"../metrics-tsdb-storage-model/retention-downsampling-cadinality-explosion\">保留期、降采样与基数爆炸</a> 讨论的存储侧压力同源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"告警状态机-for-keep_firing_for-与-alertmanager-分组\">告警状态机：for、keep_firing_for 与 Alertmanager 分组</h2><p>告警不是布尔量，而是<strong>每个序列独立维护的状态机</strong>。表达式返回的向量元素先进入 <code>active</code>；带 <code>for</code> 时它先在 <code>pending</code> 停留，连续满足该时长后才转 <code>firing</code>。设求值周期为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>、<code>for</code> 时长为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>，则从首次触发到 firing 需要的连续求值次数为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌈</mo><mfrac><mi>F</mi><mi>T</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌉</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = \\left\\lceil \\frac{F}{T} \\right\\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌈</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Prometheus 官方措辞是「check that the alert continues to be active during each evaluation」——<strong>逐次求值累加</strong>，不是单次窗口判断（<a href=\"https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration/alerting_rules/\">alerting rules</a>）。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 必须显著大于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F=T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 时一次求值就可能 firing，两者同量级时告警会在边界抖动。<code>keep_firing_for</code>（vmalert 中默认 <code>0s</code>）解决<strong>假解决</strong>：条件刚不满足时保持 firing 一段时间，防止抓取丢点造成的闪断重发。</p>\n<p>告警进入 Alertmanager 后，噪声由分组参数控制（<a href=\"https://github.com/prometheus/alertmanager/blob/main/docs/configuration.md\">Alertmanager configuration</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>group_wait</code></td>\n<td><strong>30s</strong></td>\n<td>新分组首次通知前等待，合并同一故障的多个告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>group_interval</code></td>\n<td><strong>5m</strong></td>\n<td>分组内新增/恢复后的再次检查周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>repeat_interval</code></td>\n<td><strong>4h</strong></td>\n<td>未变化的 firing 告警重复发送间隔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>resolve_timeout</code></td>\n<td><strong>5m</strong></td>\n<td>无新告警后判定分组已解决的时间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>group_wait</code> 若短于 <code>for</code> 的收敛时间，会先发一批随后立刻补充，形成「两封邮件」；它同时也是通知的<strong>上下文超时</strong>，发送耗时超过它通知会被取消。这两个值必须与规则层的 <code>for</code> 一起调，而非各自独立设。</p>\n<p>状态持久化是 Mimir 与 vmalert 的分水岭。Mimir 的 ruler 把告警状态写在 <code>ALERTS</code> / <code>ALERTS_FOR_STATE</code> 序列里；vmalert 只有配置了 <code>-remoteRead.url</code> 才在重启时恢复 <code>ALERTS_FOR_STATE</code>，恢复的规则打上 <code>restored</code> 标签（<a href=\"https://docs.victoriametrics.com/victoriametrics/vmalert/\">vmalert</a>）。未配持久化的 vmalert 重启后所有 <code>for</code> 计时归零，一次滚动重启就可能让长 <code>for</code> 告警延迟整整一个 <code>for</code> 时长才重新 firing。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多租户规则管理与容量限制\">多租户规则管理与容量限制</h2><p>Mimir 的规则<strong>按租户隔离</strong>：每个租户拥有自己的 namespace 与 rule group，<code>ruler_storage.backend</code> 支持 <code>s3</code>/<code>gcs</code>/<code>azure</code>/<code>swift</code>/<code>local</code>，其中 local 后端<strong>只读</strong>，无法通过 HTTP 配置 API 创建或删除规则，只适合 ConfigMap 挂载固定文件的场景（<a href=\"https://grafana.com/docs/mimir/latest/references/architecture/components/ruler/\">Mimir ruler</a>）。</p>\n<p>横向扩展靠 ruler 哈希环：规则组按 tenant 分片到不同 replica 执行，<code>-ruler.tenant-shard-size</code>（默认 <strong>0</strong>）为 0 时全量分片。分片的隐含前提是<strong>每个 replica 持有相同的规则文件源</strong>，否则某组规则可能没有 replica 去跑。</p>\n<p>关键容量与并发参数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>默认</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>-ruler.max-rule-groups-per-tenant</code></td>\n<td>70</td>\n<td>单租户规则组上限，0 关闭</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-ruler.max-rules-per-rule-group</code></td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>单组规则数上限，0 关闭</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-ruler.max-independent-rule-evaluation-concurrency</code></td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>全局独立规则并发（0=关闭）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-ruler.max-independent-rule-evaluation-concurrency-per-tenant</code></td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>单租户独立规则并发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-ruler.poll-interval</code></td>\n<td>10m</td>\n<td>从对象存储重同步规则的周期</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>max-independent-rule-evaluation-concurrency</code> 的语义是<strong>只有互不依赖的规则</strong>才允许并发，触发阈值由 <code>-ruler.independent-rule-evaluation-concurrency-min-duration-percentage</code>（默认 <strong>50</strong>）控制——规则组运行时长必须超过求值区间的 50% 才纳入并发候选。用意很明确：跑得快的规则不需要并发，只有已逼近超时的组才值得并行化。</p>\n<p>跨租户求值由 <code>source_tenants</code> 字段触发，需<strong>同时</strong>打开 <code>-ruler.tenant-federation.enabled</code> 与 <code>-tenant-federation.enabled</code>（默认均 <code>false</code>）。各源租户的查询限额分别生效，<strong>任一租户超限或查询失败即整体失败、不保存部分结果</strong>；更危险的是权限维度——联邦规则可以把 A 租户的派生数据写进 B 租户，官方文档直接提示「access control should be planned carefully」。这与 <a href=\"../mimir-architecture-scale/multitenancy-limits-scaleout\">多租户与限额</a> 中讨论的租户边界是同一类风险。</p>\n<p>结果写回路径同样可配：默认走内部 distributor，设 <code>-ruler.distributor.address</code> 后改为经 gRPC 推到远端 distributor（<code>remote-timeout</code> 默认 <strong>10s</strong>）。全局 ruler 部署通常同时配远端求值与远端写入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"线上故障排查路径\">线上故障排查路径</h2><p>将上述机制映射成症状到根因的对照表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>首查项</th>\n<th>常见根因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>记录规则序列规律性空洞</td>\n<td>写入延迟 vs <code>query_offset</code> / <code>evaluation_delay</code></td>\n<td>offset 小于远端写入延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高基数规则偶发丢点</td>\n<td>求值耗时 vs <code>evaluation_interval</code></td>\n<td>internal 模式无查询加速，未配 query-frontend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>告警延迟整整一个 <code>for</code></td>\n<td>vmalert 是否配 <code>remoteRead.url</code></td>\n<td>重启后 <code>ALERTS_FOR_STATE</code> 未恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同一故障收到两封通知</td>\n<td><code>group_wait</code> vs <code>for</code></td>\n<td>分组等待短于告警收敛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通知被静默取消</td>\n<td><code>group_interval</code> 超时</td>\n<td>通知发送耗时超过分组周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分片后某组规则不执行</td>\n<td>分片与规则文件一致性</td>\n<td>replica 持有的规则源不一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>联邦规则整组失败</td>\n<td>各源租户限额</td>\n<td>任一源租户超限即放弃全部结果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>诊断入口是开启 <code>-ruler.query-stats-enabled</code>（默认 <code>false</code>），它把每次规则查询的墙钟耗时按租户记为指标并输出 info 日志——有这条指标才能判断「规则本身慢」还是「读取路径慢」。规则语法用 <code>promtool check rules &lt;file&gt;</code> 离线校验，返回码 0/1 可在 CI 中阻断。</p>\n<p>最后一条经验规则：<strong>改 <code>evaluation_interval</code> 前先检查 <code>for</code> 与 <code>group_wait</code></strong>。三者共享同一条时间尺度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = \\lceil F/T \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span> 意味着把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 从 1m 改成 30s 会让所有 <code>for=10m</code> 的告警需要 20 次连续求值而非 10 次。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>时序对齐、命名层级、告警收敛、状态持久化、租户限额这五件事必须联合设计，参数从不单独生效。这些机制与 <a href=\"../mimir-architecture-scale/microservice-read-write-path\">微服务读写路径</a> 中的组件拓扑一一对应：ruler 求值走 querier、写入走 distributor，任一环节的容量变化都会先在这里显影。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Recording/Alerting Rules 工程化与线上故障排查","id":"recording-alerting-rules-工程化与线上故障排查"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：interval、offset、delay 三者互不替代","id":"核心概念-interval-offset-delay-三者互不替代"},{"level":2,"text":"规则命名与聚合层级：level:metric:operations","id":"规则命名与聚合层级-level-metric-operations"},{"level":2,"text":"告警状态机：for、keep_firing_for 与 Alertmanager 分组","id":"告警状态机-for-keep_firing_for-与-alertmanager-分组"},{"level":2,"text":"多租户规则管理与容量限制","id":"多租户规则管理与容量限制"},{"level":2,"text":"线上故障排查路径","id":"线上故障排查路径"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"查询性能调优、结果缓存与远程读/联邦机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/grafana-mimir-victoriametrics-metrics-tsdb/operations-query-promql/query-performance-cache-remote-read"},"next":null}